  "maker_comment_excerpt": "Hi Product Hunt, I'm Jenny, from the Voiskey team. We started this because of the same wall we kept hitting - AI dictation still isn't truly edit-free. The text comes out polished, and a lot of the time sanded flat: a message to a friend comes back like a memo, or a note to a colleague comes back like a template. None of it sounds like you, so you have to go back in and manually re-edit it before you send it. That's what Voiskey is built around. We called it \"expression intelligence\". Voiskey do",
